haro'pi ca tapastepe girijāgaṇasaṃyutaḥ|
tasya dhyānaṃ pūjanaṃ ca smaraṇaṃ te vyadhurdvijāḥ|| 35||

mayūreśaḥ punarbālaiḥ krīḍati sma yathā purā|| 36||

iti śrīgaṇeśapurāṇe krīḍākhaṇḍe kamalāsuravadhonāma tryuttaraśatata mo'dhyāyaḥ|| 103||

